/* Public independent oracle: S(u,v)=(12u(1-u),12u*u(1-u),v),
   u in[0,1], v in[0,5]. Two source closed rings, each based at u=.5.
   Open lateral surface role. A computational seam may be needed in target UV;
   source vertices and complete defining curves must not move. */
